-- title:
--   State classification uses no independence-oracle calls
-- statement:
--   For any $n\in\mathbb N$ and any paired state $S\subseteq[n]\times\{0,1\}$, the occupancy classifier has oracle cost $$\operatorname{oracleCalls}(\operatorname{classifyState}(S))=0.$$ The classifier distinguishes transversals, states with one empty and one full pair and one selected label at every other pair, and invalid occupancy patterns.
